<title>JAPAN: Japan says won't cut Canadian grain imports.</title>
<headline>Japan says won't cut Canadian grain imports.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-03-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Japan's Food Agency said on Friday that it will not cut grain imports from Canada due to shipment delays caused by bad weather there.</p>
</text>
